#algbox([off-policy MC 预测（策略评估），用于估计 $Q approx q_pi$])[
  输入：一个任意的目标策略 $pi$ \
  初始化，对全部的 $s in cal(S)$、$a in cal(A)(s)$：\
  #h(1.5em) $Q(s, a) in bb(R)$（任意取值）\
  #h(1.5em) $C(s, a) arrow.l 0$

  永久循环（对每个回合）：\
  #h(1.5em) $b arrow.l "any policy with coverage of" pi$ \
  #h(1.5em) 遵循 $b$ 生成一个回合：$S_0, A_0, R_1, dots.c, S_(T-1), A_(T-1), R_T$ \
  #h(1.5em) $G arrow.l 0$ \
  #h(1.5em) $W arrow.l 1$ \
  #h(1.5em) 对回合的每一步循环，$t = T-1, T-2, dots.c, 0$，当 $W != 0$ 时：\
  #h(3em) $G arrow.l gamma G + R_(t+1)$ \
  #h(3em) $C(S_t, A_t) arrow.l C(S_t, A_t) + W$ \
  #h(3em) $Q(S_t, A_t) arrow.l Q(S_t, A_t) + frac(W, C(S_t, A_t)) [G - Q(S_t, A_t)]$ \
  #h(3em) $W arrow.l W frac(pi (A_t|S_t), b(A_t|S_t))$
]
